<div id="layer-parches-juego" class="app-layer hidden flex flex-col p-4 h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#060913]">
 <header class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/5 pb-3 shrink-0"><div><p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.3em] text-violet-300">GOLDHEN · GAME PATCH</p><h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight">Parches de juego</h2></div><button onclick="volverAlLauncher()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl border border-white/10 text-gray-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i></button></header>
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 py-3 shrink-0"><button onclick="parchesRecargar()" class="h-9 rounded-xl border border-violet-400/20 bg-violet-400/5 px-3 text-[10px] font-bold text-violet-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate mr-1"></i> Actualizar</button><span id="patch-count" class="text-[9px] text-gray-300">Sin analizar</span><span id="patch-connection" class="ml-auto text-[8px] font-mono text-gray-500">Conexión FTP pendiente</span></div>
 <details class="mb-3 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.025] p-2"><summary class="cursor-pointer text-[9px] font-bold text-gray-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired mr-1 text-violet-300"></i> Conexión FTP · cambiar IP o puerto</summary><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><label class="min-w-[150px] flex-1"><span class="mb-1 block text-[8px] text-gray-500">IP de PS4</span><input id="patch-ip" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="192.168.1.40" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/30 px-2 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] text-white outline-none"></label><label><span class="mb-1 block text-[8px] text-gray-500">Puerto FTP</span><select id="patch-port" class="rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#080d17] px-2 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] text-white"><option value="2121">2121</option><option value="2122">2122</option></select></label><button onclick="parchesGuardarConexion()" class="self-end rounded-lg bg-violet-400/15 px-3 py-2 text-[9px] font-bold text-violet-100">Guardar y conectar</button></div><p class="mt-2 text-[8px] text-gray-500">Se actualizará la conexión compartida con los demás módulos.</p></details>
 <div id="patch-plugin-status" class="mb-3 space-y-2 shrink-0"></div>
 <div id="patch-no-games" class="hidden rounded-2xl border border-amber-400/20 bg-amber-400/5 p-4 text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-amber-100"><b>No se encontraron parches para los juegos instalados.</b><br>En GoldHEN → Settings → Plugin Settings configura <b>Patch Source: Net Github</b>, <b>Patch Selection: All Patches</b> y <b>Plugin Source: Net Github</b>. Después ejecuta <b>Update patch archive</b> y <b>Update plugin archive</b> y pulsa Actualizar aquí.</div>
 <main id="patch-game-list" class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar space-y-2 pb-24"></main>
</div>
<div id="patch-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[11000] hidden items-end justify-center bg-black/80 p-3 sm:items-center" onclick="if(event.target===this)parchesCerrarJuego()"><div class="w-full max-w-xl max-h-[86dvh] overflow-y-auto rounded-3xl border border-violet-400/20 bg-[#0a0f1a] p-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div><p id="patch-modal-cusa" class="text-[9px] font-mono text-violet-300"></p><h3 id="patch-modal-title" class="text-lg font-black text-white"></h3></div><button onclick="parchesCerrarJuego()" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-white/5"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div><div id="patch-modal-list" class="mt-3 space-y-2"></div><p class="mt-3 text-[9px] text-gray-500">Los cambios se aplican al iniciar el juego. No combines parches que indiquen incompatibilidad en sus notas.</p></div></div>
